@airindiain

I am travelling to Singapore with my family including my parents on 14th February 2020 I don't think it would be a right time to travel because of ongoing Corona Virus.

We request you to please allow free rescheduling or cancellation for India to Singapore flights. https://t.co/iVOiG8K8o3

@jackmurphylive I am not in favor of the Chinese approach. 

I was in China on January 13th -19th. Taiwan on January 20th. Bali on January 21-25th. Singapore in February 20th-25th and Korea on February 25th-28th. 

COVID-19 is no excuse for the civil rights violations in China.
